/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
# Local packaging artefacts; the release build makes its own in CI.
*.zip

# Working notes. README.md is the only Markdown file this repository carries;
# the rest are kept locally and are not part of what is published.
issues.md
CHANGELOG.md
CHANGES.md
KNOWN_ISSUES.md

# Screen captures taken while working through the issue list.
*.png
*.webm

# Verification passes: screenshots and the scenes they were taken from. They are
# evidence for one run on one machine, they are large, and they are kept locally
# like the rest of the working notes above -- nothing in them is published.
verification-*/

# Models exported from those scenes, one directory per pass. Build output:
# reproducible from the scene beside it with examples/export_project.rs.
/exports/
